[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] -------------------------------------------------
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] To use cups-pdf, restart cups and visit the cups
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] web interface at http://localhost:631/
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] 
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] You can now add a "Virtual Printer (PDF Printer)"
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] and use the Postscript/Generic postscript color
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] printer driver.
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] 
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] Note that cups-pdf has a configuration
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] file in /etc/cups. The default location for
[2026-10-03T17:44:20-0300] [ALPM-SCRIPTLET] pdf output is /var/spool/cups-pdf/$username.
